<PageTitle>Context Menu — Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn</PageTitle>

<h1 class="doc-h1">Context Menu</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">
    One <code>contextmenu</code> listener covers the right button, the context-menu key and a long press on touch, because the platform fires the same event for all three. A right-click handler on a div gets only the first.
</p>

<p class="doc-note">
    One <code>contextmenu</code> listener covers the right button, the context-menu key and a long
    press on touch — the platform fires the same event for all three. A right-click handler on a
    div gets only the first, which is how context menus end up unreachable by keyboard.
</p>
